    "name":  "LED Wall Light 8W - RIGEL - Interior Wall - 3500K",
    "reference":  "91732",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApply the 8W LED RIGEL Wall Lamp in aluminum with LED cord\u003c/strong\u003e. With its warm light of 3500K and modern design, this wall lamp is the perfect solution to bring life to your interior walls. Enjoy soft lighting and save energy at the same time. Refresh your spaces and create a cozy atmosphere.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe\u003cstrong\u003e illuminated cord\u003c/strong\u003e of the \u003cstrong\u003ewall lamp\u003c/strong\u003e is a technological innovation that stands out for its elegance and versatility for use in various environments. Its advanced light source dissipates heat very well and achieves uniform, soft, and glare-free illumination.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Wall Light 8W - RIGEL - Indoor - 3500K\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIlluminate your indoor spaces in a unique and elegant way with our outstanding \u003cstrong\u003eLED Wall Light.\u003c/strong\u003e This light combines the efficiency of LED technology with an appealing design that accentuates the modern aesthetics of your home. With its \u003cstrong\u003ewarm 3500K light\u003c/strong\u003e, you\u0027ll create a cozy and pleasant atmosphere in your living room, bedroom, or any corner you wish to highlight.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe\u003cstrong\u003e illuminated cord\u003c/strong\u003e of the \u003cstrong\u003ewall lamp\u003c/strong\u003e is a technological innovation distinguished by its elegance and versatility for use in various environments. Its advanced light source dissipates heat effectively and provides uniform, soft, and glare-free illumination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey Features:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Quality Construction:\u003c/strong\u003e Our exceptional LED Wall Light is crafted from high-quality aluminum and features an illuminated textile cord, creating a captivating visual effect. The combination of durable materials and sophisticated design ensures that this wall light is both long-lasting and aesthetically appealing.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED Lighting via a Cord:\u003c/strong\u003e The unique feature of cord lighting adds a touch of originality and creativity to your walls. The illuminated textile cord becomes a decorative element in itself, highlighting your style and personality.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIdeal for Indoors\u003c/strong\u003e: With an IP20 protection rating, this LED Wall Light is perfect for indoor installation. Decorate your spaces worry-free, as it\u0027s designed to provide quality lighting and safety in areas such as your living room, bedroom, or any place where you want to create a unique atmosphere.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironmental Protection:\u003c/strong\u003e With its low-energy LED technology, you\u0027ll be contributing to environmental conservation by reducing your carbon footprint.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eUses of the LED Wall Light 8W - RIGEL- Indoor - 3500K\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAmbient Decoration: Use our LED Wall Light as a central piece of decoration on your walls, emphasizing architectural elements or creating a unique and welcoming atmosphere in your home.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVarious Applications: Whether as the main lighting in your living room or as a wall lamp in your bedroom, this LED wall light fits perfectly into various applications, allowing you to create the desired atmosphere in every corner of your home.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestaurants or Cafés: If you own a restaurant or café, this type of wall light can add a touch of warmth and style to your space, creating a cozy atmosphere for your customers.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReading Light in Bedrooms: Mount the LED Wall Light next to the bedside in the bedroom. The pleasant light brings comfort and is ideal for reading before bedtime or for creating a relaxing atmosphere.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn summary, our outstanding LED Wall Light is the perfect choice for those seeking unique and efficient indoor lighting. It blends the elegance of modern design with environmental sustainability, offering a touch of originality and personality to your spaces. Bring your walls to life with this exceptional piece of LED lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt Factorled, we ensure that our products come with a QUALITY GUARANTEE and provide all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT, or WHOLESALE, including the technical specifications for each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
